<title>UK: Gartmore names Andrew Fleming equities head.</title>
<headline>Gartmore names Andrew Fleming equities head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gartmore Investment Management said on Monday it had appointed Andrew Fleming as head of equities following a decision to combine the UK and international equity departments.</p>
<p>Fleming was head of international equities, and takes on the extra brief of the UK equity division. UK equity head Mike Bishop will concentrate on managing several of Gartmore's key client relationships and pension fund portfolios.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5887</p>
